{"id":"n72539-1-5","stage":3,"title":"인정 · 人情","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72539-1-5-1","ko":"선배는 항상 왜 지수 편만 들어요?","zh":"学长为什么总是站在智秀那边？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선배는","meaning":"学长，师兄，师姐","explanation":"선배：学长，师兄，师姐；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66306","senseId":"2","lemma":"선배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"편만","meaning":"方","explanation":"편：方；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"2","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어요?","meaning":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","explanation":"들다：表示积极想做如前所述的行为。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49855","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"学长，师兄，师姐","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3","entryId":"66306","definition":"比自己先进入同一个学校的人。","pronunciation":["선배"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"53cb600fa1af0748","term":"편","zh":"方","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3","entryId":"71321","definition":"相互不同立场中的一边。","pronunciation":["편"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"49855","definition":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9300642b0ccf0e2a74b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72539-1-5-2","ko":"약한 사람의 편을 드는 것이 인정이야.","zh":"帮助弱者才有人情味啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약한","meaning":"薄弱，弱","explanation":"약하다：薄弱，弱；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"약하다","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71619","senseId":"3","lemma":"약하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람의","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편을","meaning":"方","explanation":"편：方；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"2","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드는","meaning":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","explanation":"들다：表示积极想做如前所述的行为。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49855","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인정이야.","meaning":"人情","explanation":"인정：人情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"인정","audio":"/audio/bb87832283f89efca668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72539","senseId":"1","lemma":"인정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"26dfca7d15ecbdb7","term":"약하다","zh":"薄弱，弱","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3","entryId":"71619","definition":"觉悟或意志等柔弱而不强。","pronunciation":["야카다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"53cb600fa1af0748","term":"편","zh":"方","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3","entryId":"71321","definition":"相互不同立场中的一边。","pronunciation":["편"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"49855","definition":"表示积极想做如前所述的行为。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"bb87832283f89efc","term":"인정","zh":"人情","audio":"/audio/bb87832283f89efca668.mp3","entryId":"72539","definition":"人原本带有的感情和心地。","pronunciation":["인정"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7ef62e35cf5193cc465.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.04,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72539","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["学长为什么总是站在智秀那边？","帮助弱者才有人情味啊。","那个人是天生的演员啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["学长为什么总是站在智秀那边？","帮助弱者才有人情味啊。","那个人是天生的演员啊。"],"answer":1}]}
